# diagonal-crossings.route's inputs to frame 5334 (overworld-continuous.route's to 4429), written by hand from there with
# the transitions at the line (--continuous-line): in 0:6c at y=19, left to x=10, two taps (4 and 5 frames) that
# leave Link at x=1 in the room, a tap of 2 that crosses into 0:6b and stops him 2 px past the line, left 6 frames
# and let go in the scroll, right back across the line into 0:6c, left 30 frames and right turned back in the scroll,
# right through 0:6c to x=109, up to y=8, a tap of 5 that leaves him at y=3, up 6 frames across into 0:5c, and down
# back across, nothing after.
